# Deploy after changes

When you finish meaningful changes to this project (features, fixes, content updates):

1. **Verify** — run `npm run build` if the change touches app code.
2. **Commit** — stage relevant files with a clear message (skip `.env*` secrets).
3. **Push** — `git push origin main` to `https://github.com/Mohanakrishnan02/mill`.
4. **Deploy** — Vercel auto-deploys from `main`. If push fails or Vercel is disconnected, run `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes`.
5. **Alias** — new prod deploys may only alias `mill-mauve.vercel.app`. If `jayalakshmivilas.vercel.app` is stale, run `npx vercel alias set <latest-prod-url> jayalakshmivilas.vercel.app`.
6. **Confirm** — tell the user the live URL: **https://jayalakshmivilas.vercel.app**

GitHub auth: use `gh auth setup-git` if HTTPS push fails.

Do not ask the user to deploy manually unless auth is blocked and they must log in.
